		{
			title: "Supremium 工具"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "The Supremium Tools are modular tools added by Mystical Agriculture. While they don't have as many possibilities as other modular items, they have infinity durability, and besides they possibility of receiving one module at a time, they can also be Enchanted! Finishing this quest, will give you a Supremium Paxel, which is a Legendary Multi-Tool which cannot be crafted, or obtained in other ways"
